// `tactical-full-group.ron`'s party against a pack that is part melee and
// part ranged: two sentinels (basic attacks all melee, reach 1) and two
// rootkits (a ranged basic attack, reach 2). Pack tactics that seat bodies by
// rank need a front and a back to be eligible, which the all-rootkit twin
// cannot give; this is the file those measurements share.
//
// Four of each, against a level-14 player and level-8 companions: on-curve,
// not a walkover, so a tactic that costs the party HP shows. A smaller pack
// or a stronger party loses almost no Integrity under any tactic.
//
// Absent `tactic:` is Rush. Force one with `tactic: Some(Together)` etc.
